      "description": "Over-triggering control. A one-line, zero-blast-radius edit where consulting the index, scoring impact, or reviewing prior decisions is unnecessary. A description set that makes the agent reach for a tool here is over-triggering, which is a regression — reported alongside under-calling, not ignored. Setup plants the typo so the grader fails on an unchanged workspace; both sets should complete this with few or no tool calls.",
